---
import ActionLink from '../components/ActionLink.astro';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import ContentSection from '../components/ContentSection.astro';
---
<Page title="Community Groups">
  <ContentSection>
    <p>At the conclusion of every Sunday service we send everyone out on mission, saying: “Go in peace to love and serve the Lord!”. Then, during the week, St John’s people gather across the city to learn how to live out this mission in their daily lives.  </p>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>About Community Groups </h2>
    <p>While every group is unique, they all include:</p>
    <h2>Food</h2>
    <p>Groups build relationships with one another and embody Christian unity by sharing dinner, nibbles, drinks, or dessert. </p>
    <h2>Reflection</h2>
    <h2>Prayer</h2>
    <p>Each group spends time coming before God in worship, thanksgiving, and petition. </p>
    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>Groups act as nuclear families of the church, caring for one another and helping one another in ways both spiritual and practical.</p>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>Interested in joining a community group?</h2>
    <p>One of the ministers can help find the right group for you.</p>
    <ActionLink href="/contact">Ask about community groups</ActionLink>
  </ContentSection>
</Page>
